    "detailed_description": "<strong><i><u>Nothing is ever simple in Rosemont.</u></i></strong><br><br><strong>Rosemont, Namalia</strong> is a <i>massive cultural city</i> full of opportunities. People dream of going there to discover themselves. What people don't know is that the city is run by six different families: <strong>Avesio</strong>, <strong>Canazino</strong>, <strong>Feliciano</strong>, <strong>Felidatto</strong>, <strong>Finopaso</strong> and <strong>Peratili</strong>.<br><br>After the death of Sebastian's father, <i>Livio Kittorio</i>, Sebastian moves back to Rosemont where the mystery of his father leads him to joining the <i>Felidatto family</i>. However, odd disappearances and mysterious deaths begin to plague the city and what seems like a simple mystery turns to <i>madness</i> as his world is <i>turned upside down</i>.<br><br><br>\ud83d\udd38 Join the Meowfia and take on the other Families!<br>\ud83d\udd38 Get to know and max out 24 Friendships!<br>\ud83d\udd38 What is The Paramount Feather? As chaos reigns, this artifact the others are fighting to find could be yours.",
